{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "So, it was a walk in the park for India. Now, the Indian team plays New Zealand in their encounter while Japan will face Sri Lanka. India's game starts on the 24th January, Friday at 1000 local (0800 GMT). Till then, cheers and take care.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:58:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Indian U19 skipper, Priyam Garg, says he is very happy with the performance. Says that he is very happy with the spinners but the lines and lengths in the start by the seamers could have been better. When asked that coming into this tournament, does it act as extra pressure that India are the defending champions, Garg replies that it's not pressure but it is instead a very good opportunity for them. Adds that they are not thinking that they are the defending champions and are taking each game as it comes.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:58:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Japan U19 skipper, Marcus Thurgate, says that they knew it was going to be a very tough game. Adds they could have batted well but will take the positives from this game. Ends by saying he is looking to learn from the mistakes and keep getting better.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:55:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "RAVI BISHNOI IS NAMED THE MAN OF THE MATCH for his 4-fer. Tells that he is really happy and excited to be getting his first Man of the Match award internationally. Tells that he wanted to bowl wicket-to-wicket and he did that really well here. Says that he will continue to come up with similar performances in the coming matches.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:46:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the day, Japan were dismissed for 41 runs as the Indian bowlers rolled them over. The highest score made by an individual for Japan was 7 runs as India showed their experience and class. Ravi Bishnoi was the pick of the bowlers as he picked a 4-fer, weaving his web around the Japanese batters.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:41:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Jaiswal and Kushagra walked out to the middle and chased down the target easily with Jaiswal especially displaying his wide array of shots. It was an easy task and the Indian openers ensured that hard work was not made of it. There was nothing for the Japanese bowlers to defend and they did not have a major role to play in this match.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:41:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "That is it! India have finished the match in a jiffy and without breaking a sweat. 29 balls is all it took for the Indians to chase down the target and end this match.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:41:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,199,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74390", "Bowler_Name": "Ashley Thurgate", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "There it is. Full ball on off, Kushagra drives it to the gap between point and covers for a single. INDIA WIN BY 10 WICKETS.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:40:19+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "7,312,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74390", "Bowler_Name": "Ashley Thurgate", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Flighted ball around off and middle, it is worked between mid on and mid-wicket for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:39:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74390", "Bowler_Name": "Ashley Thurgate", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Tossed up ball around off, pushed towards the off side.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:39:28+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74390", "Bowler_Name": "Ashley Thurgate", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Full and on middle, worked towards mid-wicket.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:39:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,10,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74390", "Bowler_Name": "Ashley Thurgate", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "FOUR! Poor ball to start the spell and Kushagra punishes him. A half-tracker down the leg side, Kushagra pulls it to deep square leg and the ball races away to the fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:38:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Ashley Thurgate to bowl now.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:38:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Flatter ball outside off, Jaiswal guides it to the man at point off the angled bat. 7 more needed.", "Summary": {"Score": "35/0", "Over": "4", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "69238", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "29", "Balls": "18", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "74097", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "74392", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:37:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,193,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Full ball outside off, Kushagra pushes it through covers for a single.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:36:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,1,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "A quick run now! A floated ball on middle and leg, Jaiswal works it behind square leg for a quick run.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:36:07+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Flighted ball on middle, worked towards mid-wicket.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:35:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,158,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "FOUR! Another one! This has been cut away! Short and outside off, Jaiswal goes on the back foot and cuts it through backward point. The fielder there gives it a chase but he cannot get there.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:35:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,268,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "FOUR! Creamed! Jaiswal is on the charge here. A full ball on off, Jaiswal just pushes at it with a straight bat and it races to the long off fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:34:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,280,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Another full ball around off and middle, it is easily pushed to long on for a single. 15 from the over. Another 17 needed.", "Summary": {"Score": "25/0", "Over": "3", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "69238", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "20", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "74097", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "74386", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:33:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,299,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "FOUR! Another boundary. A full ball outside off, Jaiswal gets down on one knee and slogs it over mid on for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:32:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,266,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "SIX! That goes all the way now! This is a brilliant shot from Jaiswal. A full ball outside off, Jaiswal tonks it over long off for a biggie.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:32:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,329,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "FOUR! Smashed! Short and on middle, Jaiswal rocks on the back foot and pulls it over mid-wicket for another boundary.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:31:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Flatter ball on off, pushed to mid off this time off the back foot.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:31:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Flatter ball on middle, it is pushed to mid on.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:30:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Good length ball outside off, it is tapped towards point.", "Summary": {"Score": "10/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "74097", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "5", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "69238", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "74392", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:29:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,1,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Short and on middle for the left-hander. Jaiswal pulls it to deep square leg but there is a fielder in the deep, so only a run.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:29:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,358,1", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Length ball around off, Kushagra works it behind square leg for a single.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:28:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,349,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "FOUR! Pulled away! First boundary for Kushagra and he is off the mark too. A back of a length ball on middle, Kushagra pulls it nicely and it races away to the deep square leg fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:27:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "In the channel outside off, slightly shorter in length. Kushagra lets it be.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:27:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74392", "Bowler_Name": "Kento Dobell", "Batsman": "74097", "Batsman_Name": "Kumar Kushagra", "Commentary": "Fuller and on off from Dobell first up. Kushagra keeps it out coming forward.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:26:56+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Dobell to bowl from the other end.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:26:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Around off and middle, pushed to mid off. 4 from the first over.", "Summary": {"Score": "4/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "69238", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "74097", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "74386", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:25:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Another flighted and fuller ball, Jaiswal drills it well but straight to mid off.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:25:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "Around off and middle, it is defended.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:25:08+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "A full ball outside off, this time Jaiswal looks to heave it over cover but ends up mistiming it towards covers.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:24:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,330,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "FOUR! First one of the innings and the intent is quite clear from the Indians. They do not want to spend much time out in the middle. A loopy ball on middle, Jaiswal mows it over mid-wicket and into the fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:24:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "74386", "Bowler_Name": "Yugandhar Retharekar", "Batsman": "69238", "Batsman_Name": "Yashasvi Jaiswal", "Commentary": "A full ball on middle first up, Jaiswal lunges forward and keeps it out.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:23:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "We are back for the run chase. 42 to win. The two Indian openers Yashasvi Jaiswal and Kumar Kushagra walk out to the middle. The Japanese players take the field too. Spin to start with as Yugandhar Retharekar comes with the ball first up. Here we go...", "Timestamp": "2020-01-21T10:23:08+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "InningNo": "2", "BattingTeam_Id": "1163", "BattingTeam": "India Under-19", "BowlingTeam_Id": "2004", "BowlingTeam": "Japan Under-19", "GameCode": "inujau01212020193066", "Timestamp": "01/21/2020T16:30:02+5:30", "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 39, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:16:54 AM"}}}